# Backend Deployment Configuration

## Environment-specific Configurations

### Production (.env.production)
```
NODE_ENV=production
PORT=10000
MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://naadam-user:password@cluster.mongodb.net/naadam
JWT_SECRET=your_production_secret_key_change_this
JWT_EXPIRE=7d
```

### Development (.env.development)
```
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=5000
MONGODB_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/naadam
JWT_SECRET=dev_secret_key
JWT_EXPIRE=7d
```

### Testing (.env.test)
```
NODE_ENV=test
PORT=5001
MONGODB_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/naadam-test
JWT_SECRET=test_secret_key
JWT_EXPIRE=1h
```

## Production Checklist

- [ ] MONGODB_URI set to production database
- [ ] JWT_SECRET is strong and random
- [ ] NODE_ENV=production
- [ ] CORS configured for production domain
- [ ] Error logging enabled
- [ ] Database backups scheduled
- [ ] SSL/TLS certificates configured
- [ ] Rate limiting enabled
- [ ] Input validation strict
- [ ] Sensitive data not logged
